:: Gray District
<<incrementTime 0 2>>\
<<set $player.location="The Gray District">>\
<<getBannerForLocation $player.location>>

You make your way to the Gray District. It isn't officially a district; instead, it is the city's residential area for the poor. Everyone calls it the Gray District because of that. You sympathize with its poorer residents, but that does little to dispel the feeling that you're about to be stabbed.

Places of Interest
[[Back Alley|Gray District Back Alley]]

Travel
[[Town Center|Town Center]]

:: Gray District Back Alley
You walk down a dark, secluded alleyway. Surprisingly, you feel a little safer here, but you think that's only because nobody is around—or at least, nobody you can see.

There's a door with a giant red X on it. Usually that's used to mark the plague, but for some reason it looks a little suspicious.

[[Knock on the door|Thieves' Guild Entranceway]]
